    \caption{Critical threshold $T_c$ for $r_1=0$ as a function of the average degree $\langle k \rangle$ in the continuous regime $4 \leq \langle k \rangle \leq 24$ and metastability limit in the discontinuous regime $\langle k \rangle > 24$,  for $N=10000$ and $\pi=0.6$. Estimates were computed as the values that maximise $\chi$  and the first autocorrelation coefficient $AC(1)$. The dashed line corresponds to the mean field approximation prediction.}
    \label{fig:aprox3}
