    To complete the proof of the lemma, it remains only to bound the running time of the dynamic programming algorithm.
    \begin{claim}
        The algorithm computes $F^*_{\pi}(v,t)$ for all $v \in V$ and $t \in [T]$ in time $O(kn^3T^4)$. 
