Let $\ca{A},\ca{B},\ca{C}$ be bicategories, and suppose we have pseudofunctors $\ca{F}: \  \ca{A} \rightarrow \ca{B}$ and a $\ca{T}: \ca{A} \rightarrow \ca{C}$ as in the following figure:

