		}=\left( \int_{\mathbb{S}^{2}}{\left\vert \psi _{j,k}\left( x\right)
			\right\vert ^{q}dx}\right) ^{\frac{1}{q}}\approx \Sigma_{j;p}^{2\left( \frac{1}{2}%
			-\frac{1}{q}\right) }%=\left( h_{j}S_{j}\right) ^{d\left( \frac{1}{2}-\frac{1%
				%}{p}\right) }
