\begin{abstract}In this short note, we prove the existence of weakly malnormal, virtually free, quasiconvex
subgroups in any nonelementary hyperbolic group. This extends a result of Ilya Kapovich
appearing in \cite{kapovich-nonqc}, where he proved the existence of malnormal quasiconvex subgroups
in torsion-free hyperbolic groups.
\end{abstract}

