Figure~\ref{figure:stock-returns-data} graphs ten years of stock values for Boeing Co.\ (BA), Berkshire Hathaway Class B (BRK.B), Goldman Sachs Group Inc.\ (GS), Johnson \& Johnson (JNJ), JPMorgan Chase \& Co.\ (JPM), Coca-Cola Co.\ (KO), McDonald’s Corp.\ (MCD), Pfizer Inc.\ (PFE), Walmart Inc.\ (WMT), and Exxon Mobil Corp.\ (XOM).\footnote{Data obtained from \texttt{Microsoft Excel} using the \texttt{STOCKHISTORY} function.}
