Figure \ref{fig:cost-efficiency-analysis} synthesizes these trade-offs across performance, cost efficiency, and overall value. While OpenAI systems achieve highest accuracy (89.5-91.4\%), their poor cost efficiency limits practical deployment scalability. Conversely, VertexAI maximizes value by combining strong performance with exceptional cost efficiency, making it suitable for widespread institutional adoption.

