\begin{abstract}
We prove that there exists a C$^*$-diagonal with Cantor spectrum in the Cuntz algebra $\mathcal{O}_k$ for $2 \leq k < \infty$. 
Our method generalises to an uncountable family of UCT Kirchberg algebras with distinct K-theory.
Moreover, we construct principal étale groupoid models for these Cuntz algebras and UCT Kirchberg algebras. 
\end{abstract}

