\section*{\color{CadmiumRed}Research in automation of current mining practices}\label{sec:engr-research-interests}
This section provides a high-level overview of recent research efforts in using automation techniques to improve existing mining practices, and the role automation and digital sciences can play in delivering an autonomous mining future with greater safety, efficiency and productivity. The aim is to provide an understanding and appreciation of the engineering problems in this field, and a foundation for the deeper issues and longer-term challenges discussed in more detail in section~\ref{sec:technologies-insights}.

